# Docs First for Admin Work

`docs/` is the implementation source-of-truth for admin UX and behavior.

Before changing route behavior, page composition, navigation, permissions,
copy, validation, process, or architecture, update the matching docs in
`revisium-admin/docs/...` (or create them) before code changes.

If implementation and docs diverge, treat the PR as blocked until the same
change either updates docs or reverts code to match docs.
